The '''Stalgasin hive''' was a major [[Geonosian hive|hive]] that controlled all other major hives<ref name="Character Encylopdedia">''[[Star Wars Character Encyclopedia: Updated and Expanded]]''</ref> on the [[planet]] [[Geonosis]] on the [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] of [[the galaxy]]. It was also the planet's [[capital]]. Like all other hives, it consisted of spire-like mounds made of stone powder and [[phidna]] dung, with a vast [[Geonosian catacombs|underground network]].<ref name="AEYNK" /> It was the largest of the hives,<ref name="Star Wars: On the Front Lines">''[[Star Wars: On the Front Lines]]''</ref> and had a [[Stalgasin Hive Guard|Hive Guard]].<ref name="SHG">{{FFGXW2|set=Nantex-class Starfighter Expansion Pack|cardname=Stalgasin Hive Guard}}</ref>

Upon the creation of the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]], an alliance of [[star system]]s who wanted to secede from the [[Galactic Republic]], the Stalgasin hive became its secret&mdash;stronghold and also housed major factories, which built [[battle droid]]s, vehicles and weaponry for the Confederacy.<ref name="AEYNK" /> The first battle of the [[Clone Wars]], which pitted the Confederacy against the Republic's newly acquired [[Cloning|clone]] [[Grand Army of the Republic|army]], took place in the [[Petranaki Arena|Arena of Justice]], close to the Stalgasin hive.<ref name="AOC">{{Film|II}}</ref>

[[Queen]] [[Karina the Great]] was the queen of the hive, though [[Archduke]] [[Poggle the Lesser]] ran the hive in her name.<ref name="Helmet Collection 31">{{HelmetCollectionCite|31|Databank A-Z}}</ref> After Karina's [[death]],<ref name="Encyclopedia: Geonosis">{{SWE|locations|geonosis|Geonosis}}</ref> Poggle remained a hive leader and revealed, during the [[Eve of Meckgin Festival]] after being freed from Republic captivity, that the hive had a new queen. Poggle kept his position until his death at the [[Mission to Mustafar|end]] of the [[Clone Wars]]. After the war, the current reigning [[Unidentified Geonosian queen (Stalgasin hive)|queen]] appointed a [[Unidentified Geonosian archduke|successor]].<ref name="Catalyst" />

